    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60378" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτί̆λ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tame, docile,
			obedient</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρὴ δέ σε πατρὶ . . κτίλον ἔμμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					222
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦσαν δὲ κτίλα πάντα καὶ ἀνθρώποισι
					προσηνῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					130
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆλα</span> (sheep) <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				471
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parth.
					10.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερέα κτίλον Ἀφροδίτας</span>
			Aphrodite's <i>cherished</i> priest, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτίλα ὤεα</span>, perh. their
				<i>cherished</i> eggs, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				452
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτίλος, ὁ</span>,
				<i>ram</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.196
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				13.492
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.388
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.211
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.175
			</span></i>.</div>
